            "review_title": "Review at Hu Tieu Nam Vang Lien Hua",
            "review_text": "Jay Mapson\nClarksburg, California209 contributions\n0\npleasantly surprised and open 24 hrs\nJan 2020\nThis was our first time trying Hu Tieu and it was pretty good. I don't see myself seeking it out again but if I did I wouldn't hesitate to come back to this spot. As we had arrived the day before we found ourselves up at zero dark thirty and hungry. We jumped in a cab looking for a different dish from a place we found online close to Bui Vien St but turned out they were closed. Taxi driver recommended we try this place sine it is open 24 hours. The restaurant was clean and food was good. There is also fresh bun bao available as well and the small baguette that came with the Hu Tieu helped fill me up. We ordered dry which came with soup on the side you can also order the wet version. Don't be afraid give it a try.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 28, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
