            "review_text": "SanjiSkywalker\nLondon, United Kingdom104 contributions\n0\nAwesome 'hu tiu'!\nOct 2016 • Family\nAlways come here for 'hu tiu' everytime we fly back home. Between the soupy and dry versions, i prefer the latter one where they put all ingredients in a bowl and you mix them with soy sauce, vegetables (ask them to blanch the bean sprout so they are not too hard) and a bit of the delicious stock. Staffs are nice. Only thing prevents me from giving 5 stars is they have raised the price.\nRead more\nWritten November 2, 2016",
