            "review_text": "David S\nSydney, Australia97 contributions\n0\nGood food if your a local\nDec 2015 • Couples\nI've visited the restaurant twice in the last week as it's one of my friends favourite places for lunch. ( she's a local). Although i always finish my bowl of noodles, it's not to my liking. I do not eat any type of seafood, i can taste it and smell it a long way away and i struggle at this place because the beef noodle soup has a very strong seafood flavour about it. Nothing that a heavy dose of chilli won't fix. The restaurant is exceptionally clean, very quick service and very well priced. About 90 000vnd pp incl a drink but not very warm and welcoming to a tourist. I really feel that this is one for the locals.\nRead more\nWritten December 29, 2015",
